<title>SINGAPORE: HOTUNG SHARES DEBUT AT HIGH OF US$0.54.</title>
<headline>HOTUNG SHARES DEBUT AT HIGH OF US$0.54.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Hotung Investment Holdings Ltd's shares touched a high of US$0.54 on its debut on Monday against its initial public offer price of US$0.26.  </p>
<p>At 0121 GMT, Hotung was trading at US$0.48. Volume was brisk at 22.9 million shares.</p>
<p>Taiwan's largest venture capital investment group offered a total of 242.4 million shares in its initial public offer.</p>
<p>Some 48.4 million shares were offered to the public and 193.9 million were placed out.</p>
<p>The public tranche of the IPO was more than 10 times subscribed.</p>
